## ✅ Completed Implementation

### FR-015: Merchant Registration and Login

#### API Methods
```java
MerchantProfileResponse registerMerchant(MerchantRegistrationRequest request);
AuthResponse login(LoginRequest request);
```

#### DTOs Created
