- ✅ Stock reduction after payment

### FR-015 to FR-018: Merchant Module
- ✅ Store management (CRUD)
- ✅ Inventory tracking
- ✅ Sales reports (daily, monthly)
- ✅ Revenue analytics by category

### FR-019 to FR-023: Order Module (Payments)
